.TH SANCHALA-SOUND-THEMES 1 "2024" "Sanchala OS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sanchala-sound-themes \- System sound theme management
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sanchala-sound-themes
[\fIcommand\fR] [\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Configure system notification and event sounds.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B list
List installed sound themes
.TP
.B set \fItheme\fR
Apply sound theme
.TP
.B preview \fIevent\fR
Play sound for event
.TP
.B mute
Mute all system sounds
.TP
.B unmute
Enable system sounds
.TP
.B volume \fIlevel\fR
Set system sounds volume (0-100)
.SH EVENTS
notification, warning, error, login, logout, device-added, device-removed
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
sanchala-sound-themes set freedesktop
.TP
sanchala-sound-themes preview notification
.SH AUTHOR
Sanchala OS Team
